# === Vite Public Directory ===
# Build artifacts generated by tools/build/* go in public/ (e.g.,
# public/traits.json from traits-csv-to-json.ts). The CSV at
# design/data/robots-traits.csv is canonical; the JSON is derived.
# See design/gdd/build-deploy-pipeline.md for the contract.
