# === Re-include build-time source scripts ===
# Earlier patterns ([Bb]uild/ from Unity section, build/ from Build Output
# section) match tools/build/ as a directory and ignore it. tools/build/
# holds checked-in build scripts (e.g., traits-csv-to-json.ts), not output.
# Exceptions must come after all matching ignore patterns.
!tools/build/
!tools/build/**
